{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"先前直率流露喜欢的自在，让他更想把心意全都给出去。此刻，他欢喜得几乎发疼，越觉得自己有那么多可以给予，越舍不得让这份热切停下来。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始体验到，把心意倾注给对方，本身就能带来强烈的充实。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 9,\n      \"why\": \"从直率表达的快乐发展到给予本身的充实，既能解释此刻格外丰盛的欢喜，也能解释为何越投入越觉得意犹未尽。\",\n      \"uses\": [\"候选1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"欢喜越盛，他越急着得到对方同样深的珍惜，心里甚至有些发疼。此前他已把亲近当作安稳的依靠，如今投入得这样深，他便格外盼望这份依靠能够长久。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始迫切盼望，对方也能同样深切地珍惜这份亲近。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 9,\n      \"why\": \"此前对亲近的依赖为求得回应提供了明确原因，而这一次的急切指向双方能否共同珍惜，能解释强烈幸福中持续的紧张。\",\n      \"uses\": [\"候选2\", \"候选3\"]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3467f741-973f-439f-9bb8-2c34b05927cc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T025450977666Z", "elapsed_seconds": 78.093, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T02:56:09.078960+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ee3c9570af32e689dc2e53c13f0dfaa5ca582bc4734e5d6fffdb908b2d2e9121", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec0663976702